  "notes": "Podkrepi.bg campaign page. Distinctive: the Commissioner font renders Cyrillic with ornamental letterforms (д, т, и look italic/hand-drawn), paired with thin Montserrat light H1. Brand sky-blue (#32a9fe/#4ac3ff) for links, chips, outlined pill buttons; warm yellow (#ffd54f) for the primary 'Дарете сега' CTA and its outline 'Сподели'/'Дарете труд' siblings; navy #294e85 footer. Pills everywhere (25px radii). The sidebar card is position:sticky and stays beside content while scrolling; header shrinks from 88 to 64px on scroll and a circular back-to-top button appears. Placeholder bird-logo images stand in for beneficiary/organizer avatars; gallery images are warm desert-sunset illustrations. Pill chips under the title are in-page jump links (#expenses, #news, #wishes) — no codebook entry; filed proposal 'section-jump-links'. Donation list rows use red outline heart icons, truncated names, relative time ('преди 3 дни'). Financial chart and expense table are empty because nothing is reported yet."
